# P5 TG-REDRAW: an open tool group across a live theme switch, 256 colours.
# One command (each product's own shell tool, in its no-questions mode)
# that sleeps and then echoes a string, a number and a comment the shell
# highlighter paints. The terminal reports light while the command runs
# (the group open, its call running), the call settles and the answer
# closes the group in the light palette, then dark again.
fx: gateway p5-toolgroup-live-fx.json
xfx: gateway p5-toolgroup-live-xfx.json
fx: env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
fx: env FX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
xfx: env XFX_PERMISSION_MODE=yolo
wait 4
type run the command
wait 1
key Enter
wait 2
snap running-dark
key -H 1b 5b 3f 39 39 37 3b 32 6e
wait 1.5
snap running-light
wait 6
snap light
key -H 1b 5b 3f 39 39 37 3b 31 6e
wait 2
snap dark
